====== ASUS TUF-AX4200 ======

The ASUS TUF AX4200 is a Dual Band WiFi 6 router, featuring four Gbit LAN ports and up to 2.5 Gigabit WAN port. Supports also link aggregation on LAN up to 2 Gbit/s.

